==Future==
In an interview with ''The Hollywood Reporter'', Yamazaki expressed interest in directing a further sequel, saying although he was happy with ''Minus Zero''{{'}}s conclusion, he would be "a bit sad" if it were to be his final Godzilla film.<ref name="Davids2026-1" /><ref>{{Cite web |last=Lussier |first=Germain |date=November 6, 2026 |title=Takashi Yamazaki Hopes to Make a ''Godzilla Minus Zero'' Sequel |url=https://gizmodo.com/godzilla-minus-zero-sequel-takashi-yamazaki-2000836420 |access-date=November 8, 2026 |website=Gizmodo |language=en-US}}</ref>

